  paragraphs:
  - 'SKIPPY: Say Happy Birthday Captain! '
  - "COSMO: What? Why? It isn\u2019t your birthday today Skippy I\u2019m sure I wouldn\u2019t
    have forgotten it."
  - "SKIPPY: No, not for me! Today is Michael\u2019s birthday!"
  - 'COSMO: Skippy, who the hell is Michael?'
  - 'SKIPPY: Just this pet rat I used to have back down on Earth, wonder what the
    little guy is up to these days... '
  - "COSMO: You\u2019re a strange one Skip... "
  - 'COSMO: Happy Birthday Michael.'
